          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most households, the Camp Chef Everest 2X is the best camping stove: two strong burners and a real windscreen for camp meals and outdoor outage cooking. Choose the Coleman Triton+ to spend less, the Iwatani 35FW for the best butane burner, the Gas One GS-3900PB if you want butane or propane, the Coleman Classic butane as a budget backup, and the Jetboil Flash or MSR PocketRocket 2 for backpacking.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
